Backport of https://github.com/triton-lang/triton/pull/11245.

Support Blackwell NVFP4 MMA with MN-major operand fallback and validate scale formats.
mxf4/mxf4nvf4 instructions do not support MN-major operands, so FP4 x FP4 falls back
to mxf8f6f4 if either operand is not K-packed. However, mxf4nvf4 supports UE4M3/UE5M3
scales while the mxf8f6f4 fallback only supports E8M0 scales; this patch adds validation
to disallow unsupported scale formats with MN-major operands and configures FP4 padding.

